ins the implementation for scanning text inputs for potential prompt injection attacks. It uses a predefined list of regex patterns to identify malicious instructions and logs attempts via an EventLog system.","sessionId":"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI","subtitle":"Inspection of prompt injection detection logic","timestamp":"2026-06-26T18:00:06.730Z","title":"Read security/injection_guard.py","type":"file_read"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mqv8kzok_ec07fc0bf5c7":{"observation":{"concepts":["unit testing","intent classification","mocking async methods"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["IntentInterpreter correctly mapped 'xyzzyplex frobnicate' to EXECUTION/DEPLOY intent class via mock","Mocked _classify_with_llm was not called during the test execution"],"files":["/Users/xnch/xnchSystems"],"id":"obs_mqv8kzok_ec07fc0bf5c7","importance":5,"narrative":"Executed a standalone Python script to verify if IntentInterpreter correctly processes input. The test showed the expected intent class and action type but revealed the LLM mock was not triggered as expected, suggesting a potential issue in the interpretation flow or method interception.","sessionId":"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI","subtitle":"Running unit test for IntentInterpreter with mocked LLM","timestamp":"2026-06-26T18:00:18.594Z","title":"Verify IntentInterpreter classification logic","type":"command_run"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mqv8l80m_9925f8563407":{"observation":{"concepts":["intent classification","rule-based engine","unit testing","mocking"],"confidence":1,"facts":["_rule_classify returned None for input 'xyzzyplex frobnicate'","_recall_intent successfully identified an EXECUTION intent with DEPLOY action","LLM classification was bypassed via mock, confirming-rule-based logic paths"],"files":["/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/pipeline/intent_interpreter.py"],"id":"obs_mqv8l80m_9925f8563407","importance":5,"narrative":"Ran a standalone Python test script to debug the internal components of IntentInterpreter. The test