put Hook: llm_params\",\"type\":\"other\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv8bvil_1f61a96c82a2\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"session management\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"facts\":[\"Timestamp: 2026-06-26T17:53:13.292Z\",\"Trigger: session_updated hook\"],\"files\":[],\"id\":\"obs_mqv8bvil_1f61a96c82a2\",\"importance\":1,\"narrative\":\"A system-level session update event occurred. This indicates a state change within the active session context.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Internal hook trigger\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:53:13.292Z\",\"title\":\"System Event: session_updated\",\"type\":\"other\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv8bvjz_bb1d02ecdd4c\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"session management\",\"event hooks\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"facts\":[\"Timestamp: 2026-06-26T17:53:13.295Z\",\"Hook identifier: session_diff\"],\"files\":[],\"id\":\"obs_mqv8bvjz_bb1d02ecdd4c\",\"importance\":1,\"narrative\":\"A system hook for session differentiation was triggered at the recorded timestamp. No further details provided in the log entry.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"System hook event\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:53:13.295Z\",\"title\":\"Session Diff Hook Triggered\",\"type\":\"other\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv8bxjn_7114bcf19f00\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"Memory Compression\",\"Structured Data Extraction\",\"XML Schema\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Role: Memory compression engine for an AI coding agent\",\"Output format: Strict XML schema required\",\"Goal: Extract essential information from tool usage observations\"],\"files\":[],\"id\":\"obs_mqv8bxjn_7114bcf19f00\",\"importance\":10,\"narrative\":\"The engine is initialized to process tool observations into structured, compressed XML format. This ensures efficient long-term memory management for the AI coding agent.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Memory compression engine initialization\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:53:15.921Z\",\"title\":\"System Prompt/Instruction Update\",\"type\":\"other\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv8bxyn_e8474829bc4d\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"Python logging\",\"Perception module\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"facts\":[\"/Users/xnch/xntest/xnch/xnch/perception/attention_filter.py updated\",\"Added 'import logging' to the imports list\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/perception/attention_filter.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv8bxyn_e8474829bc4d\",\"importance\":4,\"narrative\":\"The developer added the logging module to the attention filter component, likely preparing for better observability or debugging within the perception pipeline.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Import logging module in perception module\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:53:16.460Z\",\"title\":\"Add logging to attention_filter.py\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv8bydg_f4e19ede51a0\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"Python logging\",\"Perception module\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"facts\":[\"Added logger initialization using logging.getLogger(__name__) at the top of the file.\",\"Target file: /Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/perception/attention_filter.py\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/perception/attention_filter.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv8bydg_f4e19ede51a0\",\"importance\":4,\"narrative\":\"A logger instance was added to the AttentionFilter module to enable better observability and debugging within the perception layer. This is a standard setup step for improving log tracking.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Inject logging initialization into perception/attention_filter.py\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:53:16.992Z\",\"title\":\"Add logger to AttentionFilter\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv8c1ja_7b17567cf92e\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"regex security\",\"prompt injection prevention\",\"negative lookahead\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"facts\":[\"Updated regex from `act as (?!Nexi)` to `act as (?!(Nexi|nexi))`\",\"Target file: /Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/security/injection_guard.py\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/security/injection_guard.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv8c1ja_7b17567cf92e\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"The regex pattern in the injection guard was updated to more explicitly handle case-insensitive negative lookahead for the term 'Nexi'. This enhances the security filtering against prompt injection attempts.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Modified regex pattern for Nexi-specific prompt injection protection\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:53:21.092Z\",\"title\":\"Update regex in injection_guard.py to include case-insensitive Nexi check\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv8c1o7_7f7186f97d98\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"lifecycle hook\",\"step execution\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"facts\":[\"Timestamp: 2026-06-26T17:53:21.269Z\",\"Hook type: step_finish\"],\"files\":[],\"id\":\"obs_mqv8c1o7_7f7186f97d98\",\"importance\":1,\"narrative\":\"The execution of the current task step has concluded. This marks the transition point between tool usage and the next cycle of the agent's reasoning loop.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Process completion notification\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:53:21.269Z\",\"title\":\"Step Finish Hook\",\"type\":\"other\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv8c1py_95c8ce834142\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"lifecycle hooks\",\"patch management\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"facts\":[\"The 'patch_applied' hook was triggered successfully.\"],\"files\":[],\"id\":\"obs_mqv8c1py_95c8ce834142\",\"importance\":3,\"narrative\":\"A system hook notification was received indicating that a patch has been applied. This signifies a completed modification or update in the codebase or environment.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Execution of post-patch lifecycle event\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:53:21.332Z\",\"title\":\"System Hook Triggered: patch_applied\",\"type\":\"other\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv8c6iw_b6a2dc54522a\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"Whisper transcription\",\"Audio processing\",\"Inference optimization\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"facts\":[\"Modified `_run` method in `voice_daemon.py`\",\"Added `language=\\\"en\\\"` parameter to `self._whisper_model.transcribe` call\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/perception/voice_daemon.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv8c6iw_b6a2dc54522a\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"The transcription process was updated to explicitly specify English as the target language. This ensures more consistent and predictable transcription behavior by preventing the model from attempting language detection on every segment.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Added explicit language specification to transcription call\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:53:27.558Z\",\"title\":\"Update Whisper transcription parameters\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv8c7an_211957d0ffa7\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"memory retrieval optimization\",\"vector database searching\",\"metadata filtering\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Replaced linear search through up to 5000 memories with a targeted search_memory call using metadata filter.\",\"New implementation uses exact ID filtering via search_memory(filter_metadata={\\\"id\\\": id}).\",\"Reduced computational complexity from O(N) to targeted index lookup.\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/memory/pg_episodic_store.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv8c7an_211957d0ffa7\",\"importance\":6,\"narrative\":\"Optimized the memory retrieval logic in the episodic store by replacing a full memory scan with a direct metadata-based search. This significantly improves performance when retrieving specific memories by ID.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Refactor _get_memory_by_id to use targeted search instead of full scan\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:53:28.557Z\",\"title\":\"Optimize memory retrieval in pg_episodic_store.py\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv8c8ly_d2ca2341a6d5\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"API refactoring\",\"Deprecation management\",\"Episodic memory storage\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/memory/pg_episodic_store.py: execute() now raises NotImplementedError\",\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/memory/pg_episodic_store.py: fetchval() now raises NotImplementedError\",\"Deprecated methods should be replaced by store_episode or direct agentmemory API calls\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/memory/pg_episodic_store.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv8c8ly_d2ca2341a6d5\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"Removed placeholder/stub implementations for execute and fetchval in the PostgreSQL episodic store. This enforces the use of the newer agentmemory API and prevents incorrect usage of deprecated methods.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Removing unimplemented execute and fetchval methods in episodic store\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:53:30.260Z\",\"title\":\"Refactor pg_episodic_store.py to remove deprecated stubs\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv8c9em_b2940d628c41\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"error handling\",\"redis cache invalidation\",\"asyncio\",\"logging\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Moved `import asyncio` from inside the try block to the module level.\",\"Replaced silent `pass` error handling with `logger.warning` and `exc_info=True`.\",\"Targeted file: /Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/routes/nexi_gateway.py\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/routes/nexi_gateway.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv8c9em_b2940d628c41\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"The code was updated to move the asyncio import to the top-level scope and replace a silent exception catch with proper logging. This ensures better obser