reation and search logic\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:58:45.971Z\",\"title\":\"Inspecting agentmemory/main.py implementation\",\"type\":\"file_read\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv8j2md_9f24b07f4f39\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"python package inspection\",\"function signature discovery\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"facts\":[\"Function `get_memory(category, id, include_embeddings=True)` exists at line 189 of .venv/lib/python3.13/site-packages/agentmemory/main.py\"],\"files\":[\".venv/lib/python3.13/site-packages/agentmemory/main.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv8j2md_9f24b07f4f39\",\"importance\":3,\"narrative\":\"The user executed a grep command to locate the exact definition and line number of the `get_memory` function within the installed `agentmemory` package.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Locating function definition in site-packages\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:58:49.091Z\",\"title\":\"Search for get_memory definition in agentmemory\",\"type\":\"command_run\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv8j4xk_32bff05d7f95\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"memory retrieval\",\"vector database collections\",\"embedding retrieval\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"get_memory(category, id, include_embeddings=True) retrieves specific memory by ID within a category.\",\"Uses get_client().get_or_create_collection(category) to access the relevant collection.\",\"Retrieval logic depends on get_include_types to determine if embeddings are fetched.\"],\"files\":[\".venv/lib/python3.13/site-packages/agentmemory/main.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv8j4xk_32bff05d7f95\",\"importance\":3,\"narrative\":\"Inspected the source code for the get_memory function to understand how the memory retrieval process handles category selection and embedding inclusion. This is critical for understanding the underlying data retrieval mechanism in the agent's memory system.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Reviewing memory retrieval logic in agentmemory/main.py\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:58:52.086Z\",\"title\":\"Inspect get_memory implementation\",\"type\":\"file_read\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv8j7b6_9e20bbf05aee\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"memory retrieval logic\",\"ChromaDB integration\",\"vector database querying\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"The get_memory function retrieves specific memory IDs from a collection.\",\"Uses chroma_collection_to_list to process results.\",\"Includes logging for successful and failed memory retrieval attempts.\",\"Returns the first memory object if found, or None if the list is empty.\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/.venv/lib/python3.13/site-packages/agentmemory/main.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv8j7b6_9e20bbf05aee\",\"importance\":3,\"narrative\":\"The user inspected the implementation details of the memory retrieval function within the agentmemory package. This reveals the logic used to fetch and validate individual memory entries from the vector database.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Reading lines 210-225 of the memory retrieval logic\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:58:55.168Z\",\"title\":\"Inspect agentmemory/main.py implementation\",\"type\":\"file_read\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv8jajc_192f1764b719\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"episodic memory\",\"memory retrieval\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"facts\":[\"Modified /Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/memory/pg_episodic_store.py\",\"Added 'get_memory' to the import list from 'agentmemory'\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/memory/pg_episodic_store.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv8jajc_192f1764b719\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"Updated the imports in the episodic memory storage module to include the get_memory function. This allows the module to retrieve single memory entries in addition to existing search and list capabilities.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Added get_memory import to pg_episodic_store.py\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-0