search_memory with query_text and n_results\",\"Lines 115, 149, 153, and 212 use get_memories with large n_results (up to 5000)\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/memory/pg_episodic_store.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv85plc_3f5c31f697aa\",\"importance\":4,\"narrative\":\"The user executed a grep command to inspect how memory retrieval parameters are handled in the episodic store. This helps identify the implementation details of query text processing and result limiting.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Searching for specific function calls and parameter usage\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:48:25.678Z\",\"title\":\"Grep search in pg_episodic_store.py\",\"type\":\"command_run\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv873ul_4399b1b73d82\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"task lifecycle\",\"event hooks\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"facts\":[\"The task execution cycle reached a terminal state.\",\"Timestamp: 2026-06-26T17:49:30.811Z\"],\"files\":[],\"id\":\"obs_mqv873ul_4399b1b73d82\",\"importance\":1,\"narrative\":\"The system triggered a task_completed hook, indicating the end of the current processing unit. This signals that the current context or instruction set has been finalized.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Process termination notification\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:49:30.811Z\",\"title\":\"Task Completed\",\"type\":\"task\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv873uq_e16aca92eb92\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"bug remediation\",\"Python 3.13 compatibility\",\"database connection pooling\",\"graph database synchronization\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Identified critical bugs in proactivity/engine.py, nexi/main.py, pg_episodic_store.py, and graph_store.py\",\"High priority fixes needed for xnch/main.py (Python 3.13 compatibility), context_assembler.py, and nexi_gateway.py\",\"Task 'proactivity/engine.py' marked as in_progress\"],\"files\":[\"proactivity/engine.py\",\"nexi/main.py\",\"pg_episodic_store.py\",\"graph_store.py\",\"xnch/main.py\",\"context_assembler.py\",\"nexi_gateway.py\",\"score_adapter.py\",\"graph_extractor.py\",\"consolidation.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv873uq_e16aca92eb92\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"The TODO list was updated to track a large backlog of critical and high-priority bugs across several modules, including database connection issues, logic errors in episodic storage, and architectural mismatches in the graph store.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Updated task tracking for system-wide bug remediation\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:49:30.814Z\",\"title\":\"Update TODO list with critical bug fixes\",\"type\":\"other\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv876al_cc5b8eed50b7\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"Proactive monitoring\",\"Event-driven architecture\",\"Health checks\",\"Pattern recognition failure detection\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"ProactivityEvent dataclass manages triggers, messages, priority, and expiration.\",\"ProactivityEngine monitors pattern failure rates via pattern_store.\",\"ProactivityEngine checks for stale consolidation jobs in SQLite databases.\",\"ProactivityEngine performs health checks on external HTTP services.\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/proactivity/engine.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv876al_cc5b8eed50b7\",\"importance\":3,\"narrative\":\"The file content was read to understand how the proactivity engine detects and queues automated intervention events based on pattern failure rates and system health.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Inspecting the core logic of the proactivity engine\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:49:33.980Z\",\"title\":\"Read Proactivity Engine Implementation\",\"type\":\"file_read\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv876h3_4078e00df54e\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"FastAPI lifecycle\",\"Decision Engine Pipeline\",\"Intent Interpretation\",\"Session Context Management\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"FastAPI application \\\"Nexi\\\" version 0.1.0\",\"Uses XnchClient, ModelAdapter, and IntentInterpreter for decision logic\",\"Implements a lifespan context manager for managing global service instances\",\"Endpoint /session/start handles session initialization and intent interpretation\",\"Integrates with a pipeline involving load_context, generate_options, and dispatch_execution\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/main.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv876h3_4078e00df54e\",\"importance\":4,\"narrative\":\"Read the main entry point of the Nexi application to understand the core FastAPI architecture, global state management, and the request flow for session processing.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Exploring the FastAPI application structure\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:49:34.213Z\",\"title\":\"Read main.py entry point\",\"type\":\"file_read\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv876nf_c6852afe804c\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"Pydantic Settings\",\"Environment Configuration\",\"vLLM integration\",\"LiteLLM proxy\",\"Redis caching\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Uses Pydantic BaseSettings with NEXI_ environment prefix\",\"Contains URLs for xnch (localhost:8001), vLLM (localhost:8000), and LiteLLM proxy (localhost:4000)\",\"Configures model_id as mistralai/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3\",\"Uses Redis via Unix socket for session/cache management\",\"Defines TTLs for sessions, clarification, and execution tokens\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/config.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv876nf_c6852afe804c\",\"importance\":3,\"narrative\":\"Read the global configuration file to understand service URLs, model identifiers, and timeout settings. This establishes the environment context for the Nexi application's connectivity to upstream providers.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Inspecting nexi/config.py for system parameters\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:49:34.440Z\",\"title\":\"Read configuration settings\",\"type\":\"file_read\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv876ua_97a0018b27df\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"semantic graph store\",\"entity-relation modeling\",\"agent memory layers\",\"vector-based graph storage\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Implements a GraphStore class for semantic graph memory (Layer 3).\",\"Uses 'agentmemory' categories 'entities' and 'relations' for storage.\",\"Supports upserting entities and relations with metadata.\",\"Provides methods to query entity connections and search for entities by name.\",\"Integrates with an optional relationship_store for async relationship updates.\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/memory/graph_store.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv876ua_97a0018b27df\",\"importance\":4,\"narrative\":\"Read the implementation of the GraphStore class to understand how entities and relations are persisted and queried within the agent's semantic memory layer.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Inspecting semantic graph store implementation\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:49:34.688Z\",\"title\":\"Read graph_store.py\",\"type\":\"file_read\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv87g0i_b16f3fbde006\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"pattern matching\",\"async method implementation\",\"policy pattern retrieval\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Found 2 matches in .py files\",\"policy_candidates.py (line 58) calls self._patterns.fetch_low_success\",\"pattern_store.py (line 76) defines async def fetch_low_success\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/learning/policy_candidates.py\",\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/memory/pattern_store.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv87g0i_b16f3fbde006\",\"importance\":3,\"narrative\":\"Identified the implementation and usage locations for the fetch_low_success method. This reveals the relationship between policy_candidates and pattern_store.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Searching for usage of fetch_low_success in python files\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:49:46.577Z\",\"title\":\"Grep search for fetch_low_success pattern\",\"type\":\"search\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv87g5i_85deac171a21\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"graph database operations\",\"relationship management\",\"unit testing patterns\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Found 10 matches for 'upsert_relation' in .py files\",\"Usage found in graph_store.py, relationship_store.py, graph_extractor.py, and various test files\",\"The pattern is used in both high-level graph operations and low-level store implementations\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/tests/test_relationship_store.py\",\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/memory/graph_store.py\",\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/memory/relationship_store.py\",\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/tests/test_graph_store.py\",\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/memory/graph_extractor.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv87g5i_85deac171a21\",\"importance\":3,\"narrative\":\"Ran a grep search to identify all locations where relationship upsert logic is implemented or tested. This provides a map of the relationship management flow from the extractor/graph level down to the storage layer.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Finding usage of relationship upsert logic across the codebase\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:49:46.757Z\",\"title\":\"Search for 'upsert_relation' occurrences\",\"type\":\"search\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv87gcu_6564f38c2b5f\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"pattern recognition\",\"asynchronous database access\",\"episodic memory\",\"sqlite persistence\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"PatternStore uses aiosqlite for asynchronous database operations.\",\"Implements upsert logic for patterns based on context_signature.\",\"Stores metadata including intent_class, action_type, entity_class, actor_role, success_rate, and confidence.\",\"Provides methods to fetch patterns by intent/entity/role and to identify low-success patterns for refinement.\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/memory/pattern_store.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv87gcu_6564f38c2b5f\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"The file defines the PatternStore class, which is responsible for persisting and retrieving learned patterns derived from episodic history. This serves as a long-term memory component for the agent to improve performance over time.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Inspecting the PatternStore implementation for managing aggregated patterns\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:49:47.018Z\",\"title\":\"Read pattern_store.py\",\"type\":\"file_read\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv87jyg_c6b34f137a16\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"event-driven architecture\",\"priority queue\",\"redis-backed queue\",\"pytest-asyncio\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Tests the ProactivityEngine which manages ProactivityEvent queues using Redis.\",\"Engine supports priority-based event ordering (highest priority first).\",\"Engine handles event expiration via 'expires_at' timestamp.\",\"Includes a 'check_and_queue' mechanism that triggers events based on system health (e.g., inference downtime).\",\"Uses fakeredis for unit testing the Redis-backed queue.\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/tests/test_proactivity_engine.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv87jyg_c6b34f137a16\",\"importance\":3,\"narrative\":\"Read the test suite for the proactivity engine to understand the expected behavior of event queuing, priority, and expiration. This provides the baseline for verifying any changes to the engine's logic.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/tests/test_proactivity_engine.py\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:49:51.686Z\",\"title\":\"Read Proactivity Engine test suite\",\"type\":\"file_read\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv87k6t_d6aeaefad0f5\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"LLM-based extraction\",\"Graph database\",\"Entity-relation triples\",\"Asynchronous processing\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Uses litellm for completion with 'ollama/phi3:mini' model.\",\"Extracts triples (subject, relation, object) from episodic memories.\",\"Stores results into GraphStore using upsert operations.\",\"Relies on agentmemory's get_memories for input episodes.\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/memory/graph_extractor.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv87k6t_d6aeaefad0f5\",\"importance\":4,\"narrative\":\"The file implements an asynchronous process to iterate through recent decision episodes, use an LLM to parse entities and relations, and persist these into a graph database structure.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Inspection of LLM-based entity/relation extraction logic\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:49:51.987Z\",\"title\":\"Read graph_extractor.py\",\"type\":\"file_read\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv87kci_9939b636ed7a\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"memory consolidation\",\"temporal decay algorithm\",\"graph extraction\",\"automated archival\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"The consolidation job performs summarization, graph extraction, decay recomputation, and archival.\",\"Uses `agentmemory` for storage operations.\",\"Decay formula: `importance * (2.718 ** (-0.1 * days)) * (1 + 0.1 * recall_count)`\",\"Items are archived if their `decay_score` falls below 0.1.\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/jobs/consolidation.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv87kci_9939b636ed7a\",\"importance\":4,\"narrative\":\"Read the implementation of the consolidation script to understand how the system manages memory aging, graph extraction, and archival processes. This script is central to maintaining memory efficiency by pruning or archiving low-importance data.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Inspection of the memory consolidation job logic\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:49:52.192Z\",\"title\":\"Read consolidation.py\",\"type\":\"file_read\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv87pmk_64b591caa438\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"async/await pattern\",\"pattern retrieval logic\",\"threshold-based monitoring\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Replaced synchronous `get_failing_patterns` with asynchronous `fetch_low_success`\",\"Updated parameters: success_rate_threshold (0.4) -> max_success_rate (0.4)\",\"Updated parameters: min_observations (5) -> min_confidence (0.5)\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/proactivity/engine.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv87pmk_64b591caa438\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"The pattern retrieval logic in the proactivity engine was updated to use an asynchronous method on the pattern_store. This change shifts from a count-based observation threshold to a confidence-based threshold.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Refactoring pattern_store call to use async fetch_low_success\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:49:59.034Z\",\"title\":\"Update pattern retrieval logic in engine.py\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv87rcy_730d089697cf\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"database schema refactor\",\"state management\",\"asynchronous sql queries\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"facts\":[\"Changed SQL query from checking 'MAX(run_started_at)' in 'consolidation_jobs' table to checking 'value' in 'system_state' table for key 'last_consolidation_run'\",\"Maintains the 25-hour staleness threshold check for ProactivityEvent trigger\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/proactivity/engine.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv87rcy_730d089697cf\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"The database access pattern for checking consolidation job status was updated to use a centralized system_state key instead of querying the job history table. This simplifies the lookup and relies on a single state value.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Refactor database query logic for consolidation tracking\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:50:01.281Z\",\"title\":\"Update consolidation staleness check in engine.py\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv87t6o_a241a4dc3dd5\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"database schema refactoring\",\"state management\",\"asynchronous sqlite queries\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"facts\":[\"Changed query from checking MAX(run_started_at) in 'extractor_runs' table to checking 'value' in 'system_state' table for key 'last_extraction_run'\",\"Maintains the 7-hour silence detection logic for ProactivityEvent trigger\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/proactivity/engine.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv87t6o_a241a4dc3dd5\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"The database query logic in the proactivity engine was refactored to use a centralized 'system_state' key instead of querying the 'extractor_runs' history. This simplifies the lookup for the last extraction timestamp.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Updated extraction run tracking in engine.py\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:50:03.646Z\",\"title\":\"Refactor proactivity engine database query\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv87tr1_394a8912b00e\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"service discovery\",\"health check\",\"HTTP client configuration\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"facts\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/proactivity/engine.py updated\",\"Health check URL changed from http://i9-node:8080/health to http://i9-node:8000/health\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/proactivity/engine.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv87tr1_394a8912b00e\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"Updated the port number for the health check endpoint in the proactivity engine. This likely reflects a configuration change or service migration for the i9-node service.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Changed service endpoint port from 8080 to 8000\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:50:04.379Z\",\"title\":\"Update health check port in proactivity engine\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv87u78_662e97093283\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"configuration management\",\"service discovery\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"facts\":[\"Added execution_runner_url parameter pointing to http://localhost:8002\",\"Maintained existing audit_events_path configuration\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/config.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv87u78_662e97093283\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"The configuration file was updated to include a new URL for the execution runner. This allows the system to point to a local service for task execution.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Adding execution_runner_url to configuration\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:50:04.963Z\",\"title\":\"Update config.py with execution runner URL\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv87um8_c6d26275c22b\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"configuration management\",\"refactoring\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"facts\":[\"Removed redundant string replacement logic that replaced \\\"8001\\\" with \\\"8001\\\"\",\"Changed assignment to directly use settings.execution_runner_url\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/main.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv87um8_c6d26275c22b\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"The code was refactored to remove a redundant string replacement operation on the base URL. This simplifies the configuration by relying on the pre-configured execution runner URL from settings.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Updating hardcoded URL logic in main.py\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:50:05.502Z\",\"title\":\"Refactor execution_runner_url assignment\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv880ja_faba32c9edfb\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"vector similarity retrieval\",\"threshold filtering\",\"episodic memory retrieval\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Updated the retrieval logic when embedding is None to handle query_text specifically.\",\"Introduced similarity thresholding using min_score to filter out low-confidence results.\",\"Added calculation of similarity score (1.0 - distance) for retrieved results.\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/memory/pg_episodic_store.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv880ja_faba32c9edfb\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"The retrieval logic in pg_episodic_store.py was modified to support more granular filtering of memory results based on a similarity threshold (min_score) when a query text is provided without an embedding. This ensures only relevant memories are returned.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Improved similarity filtering and query handling in episodic store\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:50:13.172Z\",\"title\":\"Refactor memory retrieval logic in pg_episodic_store.py\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv882uc_e67ec1f3b21d\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"PostgreSQL connection pooling\",\"Error handling in async database drivers\",\"Runtime error propagation\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"facts\":[\"Replaced silent failure (returning uuid.UUID(0)) with an explicit RuntimeError if the connection pool is not initialized.\",\"Ensures PostgreSQL pool availability is verified before attempting to acquire a connection.\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/memory/pg_episodic_store.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv882uc_e67ec1f3b21d\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"The method `store_decision_episode` was updated to raise a RuntimeError instead of returning a zeroed UUID when the database pool is missing. This provides better debugging visibility for uninitialized storage layers.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Refactored PostgreSQL connection pool check in pg_episodic_store.py\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:50:16.162Z\",\"title\":\"Improved error handling in store_decision_episode\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv887gh_3de08009eb8e\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"async/await pattern\",\"idempotent writes\",\"graph memory management\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Changed upsert_relation from synchronous to asynchronous (async def).\",\"Added a search check using search_memory to identify existing relations before creating new ones.\",\"Introduced update_memory call for existing relations to refresh metadata.\",\"Removed background task creation (asyncio.create_task) in favor of direct await.\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/memory/graph_store.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv887gh_3de08009eb8e\",\"importance\":6,\"narrative\":\"The upsert_relation method was refactored to be asynchronous and implement a check-before-create logic. This prevents duplicate relationship entries in the memory store by searching for existing matches before deciding to update or create.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Updating graph_store.py to prevent duplicate relations\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:50:22.143Z\",\"title\":\"Refactor upsert_relation to async and add duplicate check\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv88c6e_94086c52a71a\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"dependency injection\",\"async/await\",\"graph database\",\"refactoring\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Added `relationship_store` parameter to `extract_and_store` function.\",\"Updated `GraphStore` instantiation to accept the optional `relationship_store` argument.\",\"Changed `graph.upsert_relation` to be awaited (await graph.upsert_relation).\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/memory/graph_extractor.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv88c6e_94086c52a71a\",\"importance\":6,\"narrative\":\"Refactored the graph extraction process to allow injecting a specific relationship store. This enables better control over the GraphStore connection and introduces async handling for relation upserts.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Refactoring GraphStore instantiation in graph_extractor.py\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:50:28.260Z\",\"title\":\"Update extract_and_store to support dependency injection\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv88cwy_6a326ea854ba\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"dynamic configuration\",\"LLM model selection\",\"dependency injection\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Imported xnch_settings from xnch.config\",\"Replaced hardcoded \\\"ollama/phiess:mini\\\" with dynamic lookup using getattr\",\"Added fallback to \\\"ollama/phi3:mini\\\" if setting is not present\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/memory/graph_extractor.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv88cwy_6a326ea854ba\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"The model name for the graph extractor was hardcoded, preventing flexibility. This change allows the model to be controlled via the global configuration settings, enabling easier experimentation with different LLMs.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Modified model selection logic to support configurable model via settings\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:50:29.215Z\",\"title\":\"Refactor graph_extractor.py to use dynamic model configuration\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv88gr3_dd722cbed968\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"dependency injection\",\"batch processing\",\"data consolidation\",\"memory decay management\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Added relationship_store parameter to run_consolidation to support dependency injection.\",\"Updated extract_and_store to pass relationship_store.\",\"Replaced _recompute_decay and _archive_low_decay with a single _recompute_and_archive_decay call.\",\"Introduced retrieval of all_episodes via get_memories(EPISODE_CATEGORY, n_results=5000) before archiving.\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/jobs/consolidation.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv88gr3_dd722cbed968\",\"importance\":6,\"narrative\":\"The consolidation process was refactored to allow passing a specific relationship store. The logic now explicitly fetches a large batch of episodes (5000) to perform a combined recompute and archive step, improving the data flow for decay management.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Updating consolidation pipeline in jobs/consolidation.py\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:50:34.188Z\",\"title\":\"Refactor run_consolidation for dependency injection and improved decay logic\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv88j9i_78be0ae34f23\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"exponential decay algorithm\",\"memory management\",\"algorithmic optimization\",\"batch processing\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Merged _recompute_decay and _archive_low_decay into _recompute_and_archive_decay\",\"The new function accepts a list of episodes instead of fetching all memories internally\",\"Reduces iteration overhead by performing decay calculation and archiving check in one loop\",\"Maintains the exponential decay formula: importance * (e^-0.1 * days) * (1 + 0.1 * recall_count)\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/jobs/consolidation.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv88j9i_78be0ae34f23\",\"importance\":6,\"narrative\":\"Refactored the memory management logic to merge two separate loops (recomputing decay and archiving low-score memories) into a single, more efficient function that accepts pre-fetched episodes. This optimizes performance by reducing redundant database/memory reads.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Consolidated _recompute_decay and _archive_low_decay into a single pass\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:50:37.444Z\",\"title\":\"Refactor decay and archiving logic\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv88maw_56964579c127\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[],\"confidence\":0.85,\"facts\":[\"ScoreAdapter monitors per-dimension prediction accuracy drift (7-day vs 30-day).\",\"Triggers weight adjustment proposals if drift exceeds 0.05.\",\"Dimensions monitored: policy_score, outcome_score, risk_score, context_fit_score.\",\"Uses a POST /governance/weights/propose endpoint for adjustments.\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/learning/score_adapter.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv88maw_56964579c127\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"The file was read to understand how the system monitors accuracy drift and proposes weight changes. This component is critical for maintaining model performance stability.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Inspection of the ScoreAdapter implementation\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:50:41.382Z\",\"title\":\"Read score_adapter.py\",\"type\":\"file_read\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv88pgc_d10e8515bf98\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"Redis session management\",\"Idempotency keys\",\"Rate limiting\",\"Trust-based access control\",\"Distributed caching\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Uses Redis for session storage and rate limiting.\",\"Implements session deduplication using idempotency keys.\",\"Defines rate limits based on TrustLevel (SYSTEM, OWNER, TRUSTED_AGENT, etc.).\",\"Rate limiting uses a time-bucketed approach (per minute).\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/memory/kv_cache.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv88pgc_d10e8515bf98\",\"importance\":4,\"narrative\":\"Read the kv_cache.py file to understand how the system handles session persistence and rate limiting. The implementation uses Redis to manage idempotency keys and actor-based rate limits tied to trust levels.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Inspecting Redis-backed session deduplication and rate limiting logic\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:50:45.465Z\",\"title\":\"Read kv_cache.py\",\"type\":\"file_read\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv88s78_1252cfc298a7\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"encapsulation\",\"aioredis\",\"property decorator\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"facts\":[\"Added a property 'redis_client' to the KV cache class to return the underlying aioredis instance.\",\"Modified /Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/memory/kv_cache.py\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/memory/kv_cache.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv88s78_1252cfc298a7\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"The edit allows external components to access the redis client directly through a read-only property, improving the interface for redis-dependent operations within the KV cache.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Exposing the redis client via a property in KV cache\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:50:49.026Z\",\"title\":\"Add redis_client property to kv_cache.py\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv88teo_4f3bd6c0b551\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"APScheduler refactoring\",\"Task scheduling\",\"Code cleanup\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Removed lambda wrappers using __import__('asyncio') for scheduling tasks.\",\"Updated scheduler.add_job to use direct method references (e.g., s.pattern_extractor.run).\",\"Retained same cron timing and IDs for pattern_extractor, score_adapter, and policy_candidates.\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/main.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv88teo_4f3bd6c0b551\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"The code was refactored to remove redundant and complex lambda functions within the APScheduler job definitions. This makes the task scheduling more readable and direct by passing the methods directly.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Simplifying lambda-based task scheduling with direct method references\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:50:50.590Z\",\"title\":\"Refactor scheduler job definitions in main.py\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv88u7m_249b88e7a0fe\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"episodic memory\",\"sensory perception processing\",\"context assembly\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"facts\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/pipeline/context_assembler.py updated\",\"Added loop to iterate over relevant items and call pg_episodic.bump_recall for each ID\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/pipeline/context_assembler.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv88u7m_249b88e7a0fe\",\"importance\":6,\"narrative\":\"Modified the context assembly pipeline to ensure that relevant sensory data triggers a bump in episodic memory. This ensures that when context is assembled, related past experiences are prioritized in the episodic buffer.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Integrating episodic memory bump during perception processing\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:50:51.633Z\",\"title\":\"Update context_assembler.py to trigger episodic recall\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv88w8u_46327ff93468\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[],\"confidence\":0.75,\"facts\":[\"Changed order of operations: `app.working_memory.append_turn` for 'user' role now occurs before the LLM request.\",\"Ensures user messages are recorded in working memory even if the downstream API call fails or hangs.\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/routes/nexi_gateway.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv88w8u_46327ff93468\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"Refactored the gateway route to append the user message to working memory before initiating the LiteLLM request. This prevents loss of user context in the event of a gateway timeout or error during the LLM call.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Moved user message logging to occur before the LiteLLM API call\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:50:54.268Z\",\"title\":\"Refactor session turn logging in nexi_gateway.py\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv88x9i_c0ad8be4e8c1\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"entity resolution\",\"graph database lookup\",\"metadata extraction\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/routes/nexi_gateway.py updated\",\"New logic attempts to find entity_id by searching graph_store using raw_text or summary\",\"Added dependency on app.graph_store.get_entity_by_name\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/routes/nexi_gateway.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv88x9i_c0ad8be4e8c1\",\"importance\":6,\"narrative\":\"The entity resolution logic in nexi_gateway.py was updated to derive entity_id from text content via a graph lookup instead of relying solely on the ID present in the event payload. This enables better linking of text-based entities to the graph.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Refactoring entity identification to use text-based graph lookup\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:50:55.589Z\",\"title\":\"Update Nexi Gateway entity resolution logic\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv88xrb_c0f419845465\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"Redis client integration\",\"Dependency injection\",\"Python attribute refactoring\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"facts\":[\"Changed redis access from app.kv_cache._redis to app.kv_cache.redis_client\",\"The modification ensures ProactivityEngine uses the correct attribute name for the Redis client\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/routes/nexi_gateway.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv88xrb_c0f419845465\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"The code was updated to use the public 'redis_client' attribute instead of the private '_redis' attribute on the kv_cache object. This appears to be a correction to match the updated API of the kv_cache component.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Refactoring redis attribute access in ProactivityEngine initialization\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:50:56.229Z\",\"title\":\"Update Redis client access in nexi_gateway.py\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv88yjv_3add334aae72\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"SQL schema update\",\"JSON extraction\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"facts\":[\"The file /Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/learning/score_adapter.py could not be found for editing.\",\"The intended chan