 of the pattern store, specifically changing the method name and ensuring the mock is asynchronous to match the engine's expected execution flow.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Updating mock method name and using AsyncMock for asynchronous pattern fetching\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:51:10.368Z\",\"title\":\"Refactor mock pattern store method in test_proactivity_engine.py\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv89azd_84ced9adc472\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"pytest\",\"unit testing\",\"graph database\",\"mocking\",\"GraphStore\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Tests verify GraphStore functionality including upserting entities, relations, and querying connections.\",\"Uses unittest.mock to mock memory search and creation operations.\",\"Tests cover entity creation, updates, retrieval by name, and relationship querying.\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/tests/test_graph_store.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv89azd_84ced9adc472\",\"importance\":3,\"narrative\":\"The user read the test suite for the GraphStore component to understand the expected behavior and interface of the memory management system. This provides context for how entities and relations are persisted and queried.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Examining unit tests for GraphStore implementation\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:51:13.368Z\",\"title\":\"Read test_graph_store.py\",\"type\":\"file_read\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv89ej9_d709002ff883\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"pytest-asyncio\",\"mocking\",\"async/await\",\"unit testing\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Converted test_upsert_relation to an @pytest.mark.asyncio coroutine\",\"Added mock for search_memory to prevent side effects during upsert\",\"Awaited the store.upsert_relation call\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/tests/test_graph_store.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv89ej9_d709002ff883\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"The test case was updated to support asynchronous execution and more robust mocking of the memory search process. This ensures the test correctly handles the async nature of the graph store operations.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Refactoring test_graph_store.py for async compatibility\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:51:17.971Z\",\"title\":\"Update test_upsert_relation to async\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv89m1v_afd25b69f063\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[],\"confidence\":0.85,\"facts\":[\"Ran pytest on 194 collected items\",\"Identified failures in nexi/tests/test_context_assembler.py\",\"Tests passed for callback, classifier, context signature, evaluator, and intent interpreter\"],\"files\":[\"nexi/tests/test_context_assembler.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv89m1v_afd25b69f063\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"The full test suite was executed to verify system integrity. While most modules passed, several tests in the context assembler module failed, indicating a regression or bug in context assembly logic.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Executing pytest on the xnchSystems repository\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:51:27.711Z\",\"title\":\"Run full test suite\",\"type\":\"command_run\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv89pdf_be7fac50c8e1\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"context assembly pipeline\",\"unit testing\",\"mocking async stores\",\"proactive engine integration\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Tests cover assemble_context function using various mock stores (working_memory, pg_episodic, graph_store, relationship_store, sensory_buffer)\",\"Verifies AssembledContext message generation, including system prompts and proactivity engine integration\",\"Uses pytest and unittest.mock (AsyncMock, MagicMock) for dependency injection\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/tests/test_context_assembler.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv89pdf_be7fac50c8e1\",\"importance\":3,\"narrative\":\"Read the unit tests for the context assembler to understand the expected behavior of the pipeline, including how it handles working memory, graph entities, and proactive observations.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Reviewing unit tests for context assembly pipeline\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:51:32.017Z\",\"title\":\"Read test_context_assembler.py\",\"type\":\"file_read\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv89t4c_58f886eedcf2\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"defensive programming\",\"episodic memory retrieval\",\"safe dictionary access\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"facts\":[\"Replaced direct key access `r[\\\"id\\\"]` with `r.get(\\\"id\\\")` in the loop.\",\"Added a null check `if rid:` to prevent errors during episodic memory bumping.\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/pipeline/context_assembler.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv89t4c_58f886eedcf2\",\"importance\":5,\"narrative\":\"The update introduces defensive programming to the context assembler's retrieval loop. This ensures that if a relevant record lacks an 'id' key, the system won't crash, improving the robustness of the episodic memory update process.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Updating context_assembler.py to use safe dictionary access for episodic memory updates\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:51:36.875Z\",\"title\":\"Refactor context assembler for safer ID retrieval\",\"type\":\"file_edit\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv89twx_8616ced9540a\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"Unit testing\",\"Mocking\",\"Data schema update\"],\"confidence\":0.9,\"facts\":[\"Modified the return value of pg.retrieve_similar mock in tests/test_context_array.py\",\"Added 'id': 'ep-1' to the simulated deployment episode dictionary\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/tests/test_context_assembler.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv89twx_8616ced9540a\",\"importance\":4,\"narrative\":\"The test case was updated to include an 'id' field in the mocke