nspect the API signatures of the agentmemory module. This provides the necessary parameter structure for future memory retrieval operations.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Checking parameter requirements for search_memory and get_memories\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:57:19.591Z\",\"title\":\"Inspect agentmemory function signatures\",\"type\":\"command_run\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv8hfdl_c30fc6cfc21e\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"vector database querying\",\"ChromaDB metadata filtering\",\"similarity search\",\"memory retrieval logic\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"The `query` function implements ChromaDB-style querying with filtering capabilities.\",\"Supports metadata filtering using \\\"$eq\\\" and \\\"$and\\\" operators.\",\"Supports filtering by document content via \\\"$contains\\\".\",\"Includes distance-based filtering (min_distance and max_distance).\",\"Implements a 'novel' flag in metadata filtering.\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/.venv/lib/python3.13/site-packages/agentmemory/main.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv8hfdl_c30fc6cfc21e\",\"importance\":4,\"narrative\":\"Inspected lines 130-200 of the agentmemory main module to understand how memory retrieval, filtering, and distance thresholds are implemented.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Examining memory retrieval and querying logic\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:57:32.311Z\",\"title\":\"Inspect agentmemory/main.py internals\",\"type\":\"file_read\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv8hkjh_0dc42e4efc4a\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"ChromaDB\",\"Vector Database\",\"Persistent Client\",\"Collection Management\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"ChromaCollectionMemory wraps chromadb.Collection for CRUD operations.\",\"ChromaMemory handles PersistentClient initialization with a configurable STORAGE_PATH.\",\"Upsert logic in ChromaCollectionMemory automatically pads IDs to 16 digits if IDs are None.\",\"Uses chromadb.PersistentClient for storage.\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/.venv/lib/python3.13/site-packages/agentmemory/chroma_client.py\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv8hkjh_0dc42e4efc4a\",\"importance\":4,\"narrative\":\"The user inspected the source code of chroma_client.py to understand how the ChromaDB backend interacts with the AgentMemory interface. This reveals the structure of collection management and the specific ID generation logic for upserts.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Inspecting the ChromaDB implementation in agentmemory\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:57:39.004Z\",\"title\":\"Read chroma_client.py implementation\",\"type\":\"file_read\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv8hqgl_af563c3e53dd\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"python package management\",\"agentmemory\",\"chromadb\",\"pip dependency verification\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"agentmemory version: 0.4.8\",\"chromadb version: 1.5.9\",\"agentmemory dependencies: agentlogger, chromadb, psycopg2-binary, python-dotenv\"],\"files\":[],\"id\":\"obs_mqv8hqgl_af563c3e53dd\",\"importance\":2,\"narrative\":\"The user executed a bash command to verify the installed versions of the agentmemory and chromadb packages within the local virtual environment. This confirms the environment is correctly set up with specific versions for the memory engine.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Verifying installed versions of core memory components\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:57:46.676Z\",\"title\":\"Check agentmemory and chromadb versions\",\"type\":\"command_run\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv8huda_63e010971fc9\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"ChromaDB API\",\"Python introspection\",\"Vector database querying\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Collection.get signature accepts ids (str | List[str] | None)\",\"where filter supports complex operators: $and, $or, $gt, $gte, $lt, $lte, $ne, $eq, $in, $nin, $contains, $not_contains\",\"where_document supports $contains, $not_contains, $regex, $not_regex, $and, $or\",\"include parameter defaults to ['metadatas', 'documents']\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv8huda_63e010971fc9\",\"importance\":3,\"narrative\":\"Ran a Python script via bash to inspect the runtime signature of the ChromaDB Collection.get method. This provides the exact type hints and available query filters for the vector database API.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Checking the API signature of the Collection.get method in chromadb\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:57:51.740Z\",\"title\":\"Inspect ChromaDB Collection.get signature\",\"type\":\"command_run\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv8i0u9_9bdf2f1d60f9\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"pip installation error\",\"package version management\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"agentmemory version 0.4.9 does not exist in the package index\",\"Latest available version found was 0.4.8\",\"Current pip version is 25.1.1; upgrade to 26.1.2 is available\"],\"files\":[\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/.venv/bin/pip\"],\"id\":\"obs_mqv8i0u9_9bdf2f1d60f9\",\"importance\":3,\"narrative\":\"An attempt to install a specific version (0.4.9) of agentmemory failed because that version is not available in the repository. The highest available version is 0.4.8.\",\"sessionId\":\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\",\"subtitle\":\"Attempted to upgrade agentmemory to 0.4.9\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-26T17:58:00.127Z\",\"title\":\"Failed pip installation of agentmemory\",\"type\":\"command_run\"},\"type\":\"compressed\"},\"obs_mqv8i5eq_dd268bad7e90\":{\"observation\":{\"concepts\":[\"ChromaDB API\",\"Python introspection\",\"Vector database CRUD operations\"],\"confidence\":1,\"facts\":[\"Collection.add, update, and upsert support ids, embeddings, metadatas, documents, images, and uris.\",\"Collection.delete supports filtering via 'where' and 'where_document' dictionaries using operators like $and, $or, $gt, $lt, etc.\",\