 lifecycle hook was triggered indicating the completion of a processing step. This marks the end of a discrete unit of work in the agent's execution flow.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"System hook: step_finish\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:37:46.777Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Process Step Completion\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"other\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv7s0nf_106c2f3e6e85\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"memory management\\\",\\\"context compression\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Timestamp: 2026-06-26T17:37:46.826Z\\\",\\\"Hook: compaction_event\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv7s0nf_106c2f3e6e85\\\",\\\"importance\\\":1,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The memory compression engine has received a trigger to process a compaction event. This indicates a scheduled or reactive cycle to optimize existing context and maintain performance.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Memory compression engine triggered by compaction_event\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:37:46.826Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"System Event: Compaction Trigger\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"other\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv7s5p8_bbd0639dd7ef\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"patch application\\\",\\\"system hooks\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Timestamp: 2026-06-26T17:37:53.370Z\\\",\\\"Event type: patch_applied\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv7s5p8_bbd0639dd7ef\\\",\\\"importance\\\":3,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"A system hook was triggered indicating that a patch has been successfully applied. This signifies a state change in the codebase or environment.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"patch_applied event\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:37:53.370Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"System Hook Triggered\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"other\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"