yui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Inspecting the core logic of the proactivity engine\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:49:33.980Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read Proactivity Engine Implementation\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv876h3_4078e00df54e\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"FastAPI lifecycle\\\",\\\"Decision Engine Pipeline\\\",\\\"Intent Interpretation\\\",\\\"Session Context Management\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"FastAPI application \\\\\\\"Nexi\\\\\\\" version 0.1.0\\\",\\\"Uses XnchClient, ModelAdapter, and IntentInterpreter for decision logic\\\",\\\"Implements a lifespan context manager for managing global service instances\\\",\\\"Endpoint /session/start handles session initialization and intent interpretation\\\",\\\"Integrates with a pipeline involving load_context, generate_options, and dispatch_execution\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/main.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv876h3_4078e00df54e\\\",\\\"importance\\\":4,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Read the main entry point of the Nexi application to understand the core FastAPI architecture, global state management, and the request flow for session processing.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Exploring the FastAPI application structure\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:49:34.213Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read main.py entry point\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv876nf_c6852afe804c\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"Pydantic Settings\\\",\\\"Environment Configuration\\\",\\\"vLLM integration\\\",\\\"LiteLLM proxy\\\",\\\"Redis caching\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Uses Pydantic BaseSettings with NEXI_ environment prefix\\\",\\\"Contains URLs for xnch (localhost:8001), vLLM (localhost:8000), and LiteLLM proxy (localhost:4000)\\\",\\\"Configures model_id as mistralai/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3\\\",\\\"Uses Redis via Unix socket for session/cache management\\\",\\\"Defines TTLs for sessions, clarification, and execution tokens\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/config.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv876nf_c6852afe804c\\\",\\\"importance\\\":3,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Read the global configuration file to understand service URLs, model identifiers, and timeout settings. This establishes the environment context for the Nexi application's connectivity to upstream providers.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Inspecting nexi/config.py for system parameters\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:49:34.440Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read configuration settings\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv876ua_97a0018b27df\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"semantic graph store\\\",\\\"entity-relation modeling\\\",\\\"agent memory layers\\\",\\\"vector-based graph storage\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Implements a GraphStore class for semantic graph memory (Layer 3).\\\",\\\"Uses 'agentmemory' categories 'entities' and 'relations' for storage.\\\",\\\"Supports upserting entities and relations with metadata.\\\",\\\"Provides methods to query entity connections and search for entities by name.\\\",\\\"Integrates with an optional relationship_store for async relationship updates.\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/memory/graph_store.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv876ua_97a0018b27df\\\",\\\"importance\\\":4,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Read the implementation of the GraphStore class to understand how entities and relations are persisted and queried within the agent's semantic memory layer.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Inspecting semantic graph store implementation\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:49:34.688Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read graph_store.py\\\",\\\"type\\