\\":\\\"obs_mqv87g5i_85deac171a21\\\",\\\"importance\\\":3,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Ran a grep search to identify all locations where relationship upsert logic is implemented or tested. This provides a map of the relationship management flow from the extractor/graph level down to the storage layer.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Finding usage of relationship upsert logic across the codebase\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:49:46.757Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Search for 'upsert_relation' occurrences\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"search\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv87gcu_6564f38c2b5f\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"pattern recognition\\\",\\\"asynchronous database access\\\",\\\"episodic memory\\\",\\\"sqlite persistence\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"PatternStore uses aiosqlite for asynchronous database operations.\\\",\\\"Implements upsert logic for patterns based on context_signature.\\\",\\\"Stores metadata including intent_class, action_type, entity_class, actor_role, success_rate, and confidence.\\\",\\\"Provides methods to fetch patterns by intent/entity/role and to identify low-success patterns for refinement.\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/memory/pattern_store.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv87gcu_6564f38c2b5f\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The file defines the PatternStore class, which is responsible for persisting and retrieving learned patterns derived from episodic history. This serves as a long-term memory component for the agent to improve performance over time.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Inspecting the PatternStore implementation for managing aggregated patterns\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:49:47.018Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read pattern_store.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv87jyg_c6b34f137a16\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"event-driven architecture\\\",\\\"priority queue\\\",\\\"redis-backed queue\\\",\\\"pytest-asyncio\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Tests the ProactivityEngine which manages ProactivityEvent queues using Redis.\\\",\\\"Engine supports priority-based event ordering (highest priority first).\\\",\\\"Engine handles event expiration via 'expires_at' timestamp.\\\",\\\"Includes a 'check_and_queue' mechanism that triggers events based on system health (e.g., inference downtime).\\\",\\\"Uses fakeredis for unit testing the Redis-backed queue.\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/tests/test_proactivity_engine.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv87jyg_c6b34f137a16\\\",\\\"importance\\\":3,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Read the test suite for the proactivity engine to understand the expected behavior of event queuing, priority, and expiration. This provides the baseline for verifying any changes to the engine's logic.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/tests/test_proactivity_engine.py\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:49:51.686Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read Proactivity Engine test suite\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv87k6t_d6aeaefad0f5\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"LLM-based extraction\\\",\\\"Graph database\\\",\\\"Entity-relation triples\\\",\\\"Asynchronous processing\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Uses litellm for completion with 'ollama/phi3:mini' model.\\\",\\\"Extracts triples (subject, relation, object) from episodic memories.\\\",\\\"Stores results into GraphStore using upsert operations.\\\",\\\"Relies on agentmemory's get_memories for input episodes.\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/memory/graph_extractor.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv87k6t_d6aeaefad0f5\\\",\\\"importance\\\":4,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The file implements an asynchronous process to iterate through recent decision episodes, use an LLM to parse entities and relations, and persist these into a graph database structure.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Inspection of LLM-based entity/relation extraction logic\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:49:51.987Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read graph_extractor.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv87kci_9939b636ed7a\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"memory consolidation\\\",\\\"temporal decay algorithm\\\",\\\"graph extraction\\\",\\\"automated archival\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"The consolidation job performs summarization, graph extraction, decay recomputation, and archival.\\\",\\\"Uses `agentmemory` for storage operations.\\\",\\\"Decay formula: `importance * (2.718 ** (-0.1 * days)) * (1 + 0.1 * recall_count)`\\\",\\\"Items are archived if their `decay_score` falls below 0.1.\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/jobs/consolidation.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv87kci_9939b636ed7a\\\",\\\"importance\\\":4,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Read the implementation of the consolidation script to understand how the system manages memory aging, graph extraction, and archival processes. This script is central to maintaining memory efficiency by pruning or archiving low-importance data.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Inspection of the memory consolidation job logic\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:49:52.192Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read consolidation.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv87pmk_64b591caa438\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"async/await pattern\\\",\\\"pattern retrieval logic\\\",\\\"threshold-based monitoring\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Replaced synchronous `get_failing_patterns` with asynchronous `fetch_low_success`\\\",\\\"Updated parameters: success_rate_threshold (0.4) -> max_success_rate (0.4)\\\",\\\"Updated parameters: min_observations (5) -> min_confidence (0.5)\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/proactivity/engine.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv87pmk_64b591caa438\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The pattern retrieval logic in the proactivity engine was updated to use an asynchronous method on the pattern_store. This change shifts from a count-based observation threshold to a confidence-based threshold.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Refactoring pattern_store call to use async fetch_low_success\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:49:59.034Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Update pattern retrieval logic in engine.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv87rcy_730d089697cf\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"database schema refactor\\\",\\\"state management\\\",\\\"asynchronous sql queries\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Changed SQL query from checking 'MAX(run_started_at)' in 'consolidation_jobs' table to checking 'value' in 'system_state' table for key 'last_consolidation_run'\\\",\\\"Maintains the 25-hour staleness threshold check for ProactivityEvent trigger\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/proactivity/engine.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv87rcy_730d089697cf\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The database access pattern for checking consolidation job status was updated to use a centralized system_state key instead of querying the job history table. This simplifies the lookup and relies on a single state value.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Refactor database query logic for consolidation tracking\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:50:01.281Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Update consolidation staleness check in engine.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv87t6o_a241a4dc3dd5\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"database schema refactoring\\\",\\\"state management\\\",\\\"asynchronous sqlite queries\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Changed query from checking MAX(run_started_at) in 'extractor_runs' table to checking 'value' in 'system_state' table for key 'last_extraction_run'\\\",\\\"Maintains the 7-hour silence detection logic for ProactivityEvent trigger\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/proactivity/engine.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv87t6o_a241a4dc3dd5\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The database query logic in the proactivity engine was refactored to use a centralized 'system_state' key instead of querying the 'extractor_runs' history. This simplifies the lookup for the last extraction timestamp.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Updated extraction run tracking in engine.py\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:50:03.646Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Refactor proactivity engine database query\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv87tr1_394a8912b00e\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"service discovery\\\",\\\"health check\\\",\\\"HTTP client configuration\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/proactivity/engine.py updated\\\",\\\"Health check URL changed from http://i9-node:8080/health to http://i9-node:8000/health\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/proactivity/engine.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv87tr1_394a8912b00e\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Updated the port number for the health check endpoint in the proactivity engine. This likely reflects a configuration change or service migration for the i9-node service.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Changed service endpoint port from 8080 to 8000\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:50:04.379Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Update health check port in proactivity engine\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv87u78_662e97093283\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"configuration management\\\",\\\"service discovery\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Added execution_runner_url parameter pointing to http://localhost:8002\\\",\\\"Maintained existing audit_events_path configuration\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/config.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv87u78_662e97093283\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The configuration file was updated to include a new URL for the execution runner. This allows the system to point to a local service for task execution.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Adding execution_runner_url to configuration\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:50:04.963Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Update config.py with execution runner URL\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv87um8_c6d26275c22b\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"configuration management\\\",\\\"refactoring\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Removed redundant string replacement logic that replaced \\\\\\\"8001\\\\\\\" with \\\\\\\"8001\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"Changed assignment to directly use settings.execution_runner_url\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/main.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv87um8_c6d26275c22b\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The code was refactored to remove a redundant string replacement operation on the base URL. This simplifies the configuration by relying on the pre-configured execution runner URL from settings.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Updating hardcoded URL logic in main.py\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:50:05.502Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Refactor execution_runner_url assignment\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv880ja_faba32c9edfb\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"vector similarity retrieval\\\",\\\"threshold filtering\\\",\\\"episodic memory retrieval\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Updated the retrieval logic when embedding is None to handle query_text specifically.\\\",\\\"Introduced similarity thresholding using min_score to filter out low-confidence results.\\\",\\\"Added calculation of similarity score (1.0 - distance) for retrieved results.\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/memory/pg_episodic_store.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv880ja_faba32c9edfb\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The retrieval logic in pg_episodic_store.py was modified to support more granular filtering of memory results based on a similarity threshold (min_score) when a query text is provided without an embedding. This ensures only relevant memories are returned.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Improved similarity filtering and query handling in episodic store\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:50:13.172Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Refactor memory retrieval logic in pg_episodic_store.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv882uc_e67ec1f3b21d\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"PostgreSQL connection pooling\\\",\\\"Error handling in async database drivers\\\",\\\"Runtime error propagation\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Replaced silent failure (returning uuid.UUID(0)) with an explicit RuntimeError if the connection pool is not initialized.\\\",\\\"Ensures PostgreSQL pool availability is verified before attempting to acquire a connection.\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/memory/pg_episodic_store.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv882uc_e67ec1f3b21d\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The method `store_decision_episode` was updated to raise a RuntimeError instead of returning a zeroed UUID when the database pool is missing. This provides better debugging visibility for uninitialized storage layers.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Refactored PostgreSQL connection pool check in pg_episodic_store.py\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:50:16.162Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Improved error handling in store_decision_episode\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv887gh_3de08009eb8e\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"async/await pattern\\\",\\\"idempotent writes\\\",\\\"graph memory management\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Changed upsert_relation from synchronous to asynchronous (async def).\\\",\\\"Added a search check using search_memory to identify existing relations before creating new ones.\\\",\\\"Introduced update_memory call for existing relations to refresh metadata.\\\",\\\"Removed background task creation (asyncio.create_task) in favor of direct await.\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/memory/graph_store.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv887gh_3de08009eb8e\\\",\\\"importance\\\":6,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The upsert_relation method was refactored to be asynchronous and implement a check-before-create logic. This prevents duplicate relationship entries in the memory store by searching for existing matches before deciding to update or create.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Updating graph_store.py to prevent duplicate relations\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:50:22.143Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Refactor upsert_relation to async and add duplicate check\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv88c6e_94086c52a71a\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"dependency injection\\\",\\\"async/await\\\",\\\"graph database\\\",\\\"refactoring\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Added `relationship_store` parameter to `extract_and_store` function.\\\",\\\"Updated `GraphStore` instantiation to accept the optional `relationship_store` argument.\\\",\\\"Changed `graph.upsert_relation` to be awaited (await graph.upsert_relation).\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/memory/graph_extractor.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv88c6e_94086c52a71a\\\",\\\"importance\\\":6,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Refactored the graph extraction process to allow injecting a specific relationship store. This enables better control over the GraphStore connection and introduces async handling for relation upserts.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Refactoring GraphStore instantiation in graph_extractor.py\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:50:28.260Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Update extract_and_store to support dependency injection\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv88cwy_6a326ea854ba\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"dynamic configuration\\\",\\\"LLM model selection\\\",\\\"dependency injection\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Imported xnch_settings from xnch.config\\\",\\\"Replaced hardcoded \\\\\\\"ollama/phiess:mini\\\\\\\" with dynamic lookup using getattr\\\",\\\"Added fallback to \\\\\\\"ollama/phi3:mini\\\\\\\" if setting is not present\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/memory/graph_extractor.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv88cwy_6a326ea854ba\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The model name for the graph extractor was hardcoded, preventing flexibility. This change allows the model to be controlled via the global configuration settings, enabling easier experimentation with different LLMs.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Modified model selection logic to support configurable model via settings\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:50:29.215Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Refactor graph_extractor.py to use dynamic model configuration\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv88gr3_dd722cbed968\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"dependency injection\\\",\\\"batch processing\\\",\\\"data consolidation\\\",\\\"memory decay management\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Added relationship_store parameter to run_consolidation to support dependency injection.\\\",\\\"Updated extract_and_store to pass relationship_store.\\\",\\\"Replaced _recompute_decay and _archive_low_decay with a single _recompute_and_archive_decay call.\\\",\\\"Introduced retrieval of all_episodes via get_memories(EPISODE_CATEGORY, n_results=5000) before archiving.\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/jobs/consolidation.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv88gr3_dd722cbed968\\\",\\\"importance\\\":6,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The consolidation process was refactored to allow passing a specific relationship store. The logic now explicitly fetches a large batch of episodes (5000) to perform a combined recompute and archive step, improving the data flow for decay management.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Updating consolidation pipeline in jobs/consolidation.py\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:50:34.188Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Refactor run_consolidation for dependency injection and improved decay logic\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv88j9i_78be0ae34f23\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"exponential decay algorithm\\\",\\\"memory management\\\",\\\"algorithmic optimization\\\",\\\"batch processing\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Merged _recompute_decay and _archive_low_decay into _recompute_and_archive_decay\\\",\\\"The new function accepts a list of episodes instead of fetching all memories internally\\\",\\\"Reduces iteration overhead by performing decay calculation and archiving check in one loop\\\",\\\"Maintains the exponential decay formula: importance * (e^-0.1 * days) * (1 + 0.1 * recall_count)\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/jobs/consolidation.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv88j9i_78be0ae34f23\\\",\\\"importance\\\":6,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Refactored the memory management logic to merge two separate loops (recomputing decay and archiving low-score memories) into a single, more efficient function that accepts pre-fetched episodes. This optimizes performance by reducing redundant database/memory reads.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Consolidated _recompute_decay and _archive_low_decay into a single pass\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:50:37.444Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Refactor decay and archiving logic\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv88maw_56964579c127\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[],\\\"confidence\\\":0.85,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"ScoreAdapter monitors per-dimension prediction accuracy drift (7-day vs 30-day).\\\",\\\"Triggers weight adjustment proposals if drift exceeds 0.05.\\\",\\\"Dimensions monitored: policy_score, outcome_score, risk_score, context_fit_score.\\\",\\\"Uses a POST /governance/weights/propose endpoint for adjustments.\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/learning/score_adapter.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv88maw_56964579c127\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The file was read to understand how the system monitors accuracy drift and proposes weight changes. This component is critical for maintaining model performance stability.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Inspection of the ScoreAdapter implementation\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:50:41.382Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read score_adapter.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv88pgc_d10e8515bf98\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"Redis session management\\\",\\\"Idempotency keys\\\",\\\"Rate limiting\\\",\\\"Trust-based access control\\\",\\\"Distributed caching\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Uses Redis for session storage and rate limiting.\\\",\\\"Implements session deduplication using idempotency keys.\\\",\\\"Defines rate limits based on TrustLevel (SYSTEM, OWNER, TRUSTED_AGENT, etc.).\\\",\\\"Rate limiting uses a time-bucketed approach (per minute).\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/memory/kv_cache.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv88pgc_d10e8515bf98\\\",\\\"importance\\\":4,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Read the kv_cache.py file to understand how the system handles session persistence and rate limiting. The implementation uses Redis to manage idempotency keys and actor-based rate limits tied to trust levels.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Inspecting Redis-backed session deduplication and rate limiting logic\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:50:45.465Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read kv_cache.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv88s78_1252cfc298a7\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"encapsulation\\\",\\\"aioredis\\\",\\\"property decorator\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Added a property 'redis_client' to the KV cache class to return the underlying aioredis instance.\\\",\\\"Modified /Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/memory/kv_cache.py\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/memory/kv_cache.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv88s78_1252cfc298a7\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The edit allows external components to access the redis client directly through a read-only property, improving the interface for redis-dependent operations within the KV cache.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Exposing the redis client via a property in KV cache\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:50:49.026Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Add redis_client property to kv_cache.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv88teo_4f3bd6c0b551\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"APScheduler refactoring\\\",\\\"Task scheduling\\\",\\\"Code cleanup\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Removed lambda wrappers using __import__('asyncio') for scheduling tasks.\\\",\\\"Updated scheduler.add_job to use direct method references (e.g., s.pattern_extractor.run).\\\",\\\"Retained same cron timing and IDs for pattern_extractor, score_adapter, and policy_candidates.\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/main.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv88teo_4f3bd6c0b551\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The code was refactored to remove redundant and complex lambda functions within the APScheduler job definitions. This makes the task scheduling more readable and direct by passing the methods directly.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Simplifying lambda-based task scheduling with direct method references\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:50:50.590Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Refactor scheduler job definitions in main.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv88u7m_249b88e7a0fe\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"episodic memory\\\",\\\"sensory perception processing\\\",\\\"context assembly\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/pipeline/context_assembler.py updated\\\",\\\"Added loop to iterate over relevant items and call pg_episodic.bump_recall for each ID\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/pipeline/context_assembler.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv88u7m_249b88e7a0fe\\\",\\\"importance\\\":6,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Modified the context assembly pipeline to ensure that relevant sensory data triggers a bump in episodic memory. This ensures that when context is assembled, related past experiences are prioritized in the episodic buffer.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Integrating episodic memory bump during perception processing\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:50:51.633Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Update context_assembler.py to trigger episodic recall\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv88w8u_46327ff93468\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[],\\\"confidence\\\":0.75,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Changed order of operations: `app.working_memory.append_turn` for 'user' role now occurs before the LLM request.\\\",\\\"Ensures user messages are recorded in working memory even if the downstream API call fails or hangs.\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/routes/nexi_gateway.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv88w8u_46327ff93468\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Refactored the gateway route to append the user message to working memory before initiating the LiteLLM request. This prevents loss of user context in the event of a gateway timeout or error during the LLM call.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Moved user message logging to occur before the LiteLLM API call\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:50:54.268Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Refactor session turn logging in nexi_gateway.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv88x9i_c0ad8be4e8c1\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"entity resolution\\\",\\\"graph database lookup\\\",\\\"metadata extraction\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/routes/nexi_gateway.py updated\\\",\\\"New logic attempts to find entity_id by searching graph_store using raw_text or summary\\\",\\\"Added dependency on app.graph_store.get_entity_by_name\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/routes/nexi_gateway.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv88x9i_c0ad8be4e8c1\\\",\\\"importance\\\":6,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The entity resolution logic in nexi_gateway.py was updated to derive entity_id from text content via a graph lookup instead of relying solely on the ID present in the event payload. This enables better linking of text-based entities to the graph.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Refactoring entity identification to use text-based graph lookup\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:50:55.589Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Update Nexi Gateway entity resolution logic\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv88xrb_c0f419845465\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"Redis client integration\\\",\\\"Dependency injection\\\",\\\"Python attribute refactoring\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Changed redis access from app.kv_cache._redis to app.kv_cache.redis_client\\\",\\\"The modification ensures ProactivityEngine uses the correct attribute name for the Redis client\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/routes/nexi_gateway.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv88xrb_c0f419845465\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The code was updated to use the public 'redis_client' attribute instead of the private '_redis' attribute on the kv_cache object. This appears to be a correction to match the updated API of the kv_cache component.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Refactoring redis attribute access in ProactivityEngine initialization\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:50:56.229Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Update Redis client access in nexi_gateway.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv88yjv_3add334aae72\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"SQL schema update\\\",\\\"JSON extraction\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"The file /Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/learning/score_adapter.py could not be found for editing.\\\",\\\"The intended change was to rename 'context_json' to 'context_snapshot' in a SQL SELECT statement.\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/learning/score_adapter.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv88yjv_3add334aae72\\\",\\\"importance\\\":4,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"An attempt was made to update the SQL query in score_adapter.py to use 'context_snapshot' instead of 'context_json', but the operation failed because the file path was invalid or the file does not exist.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Attempted to update SQL query in score_adapter.py\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:50:57.257Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"File edit failed: score_adapter.py not found\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"error\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv88z05_b135f06aee97\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"JSON parsing\\\",\\\"data schema migration\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Changed key access from \\\\\\\"context_json\\\\\\\" to \\\\\\\"context_snapshot\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"Target file: /Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/learning/score_adapter.py\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/learning/score_adapter.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv88z05_b135f06aee97\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Updated the dictionary key used when parsing JSON response data in the score adapter. This change ensures compatibility with the updated data schema where the context is now labeled as a snapshot.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Renaming context_json to context_snapshot in JSON parsing logic\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:50:57.844Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Update dictionary key in score_adapter.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv891pv_3f97d271b9cb\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"SQL schema migration\\\",\\\"JSON extraction\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Changed column name from 'context_json' to 'context_snapshot' in the SELECT statement\\\",\\\"Updated JSON extraction path to use the new 'context_snapshot' column\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/learning/score_adapter.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv891pv_3f97d271b9cb\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The SQL query in score_adapter.py was updated to reflect a schema change where 'context_json' has been renamed to 'context_snapshot'. This ensures compatibility with the updated database schema.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Renaming context_json to context_snapshot in SQL selection\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:51:01.362Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Update column name in score_adapter.py SQL query\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8955v_ec5dcda706ce\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"string searching\\\",\\\"python refactoring\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Command executed: grep -n \\\\\\\"context_json\\\\\\\" /Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/xnch/learning/score_adapter.py\\\",\\\"No occurrences of \\\\\\\"context_json\\\\\\\" were found in the specified file.\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/xnch/learning/score_adapter.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8955v_ec5dcda706ce\\\",\\\"importance\\\":3,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The user attempted to locate any remaining occurrences of the 'context_json' pattern within score_adapter.py to verify its removal or usage. The search returned no results, indicating the pattern is not present in this file.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Searching score_adapter.py for remaining context_json usage\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:51:05.825Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Search for context_json references\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"command_run\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv898o2_2a091a0b69ba\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"unit testing\\\",\\\"AsyncMock\\\",\\\"mocking dependency\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Renamed `get_failing_patterns` to `fetch_low_success` in mock pattern store\\\",\\\"Changed `MagicMock` to `AsyncMock` for the new method to support awaitable behavior\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/tests/test_proactivity_engine.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv898o2_2a091a0b69ba\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The test case was updated to reflect a change in the underlying API of the pattern store, specifically changing the method name and ensuring the mock is asynchronous to match the engine's expected execution flow.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Updating mock method name and using AsyncMock for asynchronous pattern fetching\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:51:10.368Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Refactor mock pattern store method in test_proactivity_engine.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv89azd_84ced9adc472\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"pytest\\\",\\\"unit testing\\\",\\\"graph database\\\",\\\"mocking\\\",\\\"GraphStore\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Tests verify GraphStore functionality including upserting entities, relations, and querying connections.\\\",\\\"Uses unittest.mock to mock memory search and creation operations.\\\",\\\"Tests cover entity creation, updates, retrieval by name, and relationship querying.\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/tests/test_graph_store.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv89azd_84ced9adc472\\\",\\\"importance\\\":3,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The user read the test suite for the GraphStore component to understand the expected behavior and interface of the memory management system. This provides context for how entities and relations are persisted and queried.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Examining unit tests for GraphStore implementation\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:51:13.368Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read test_graph_store.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv89ej9_d709002ff883\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"pytest-asyncio\\\",\\\"mocking\\\",\\\"async/await\\\",\\\"unit testing\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Converted test_upsert_relation to an @pytest.mark.asyncio coroutine\\\",\\\"Added mock for search_memory to prevent side effects during upsert\\\",\\\"Awaited the store.upsert_relation call\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/tests/test_graph_store.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv89ej9_d709002ff883\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The test case was updated to support asynchronous execution and more robust mocking of the memory search process. This ensures the test correctly handles the async nature of the graph store operations.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Refactoring test_graph_store.py for async compatibility\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:51:17.971Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Update test_upsert_relation to async\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv89m1v_afd25b69f063\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[],\\\"confidence\\\":0.85,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Ran pytest on 194 collected items\\\",\\\"Identified failures in nexi/tests/test_context_assembler.py\\\",\\\"Tests passed for callback, classifier, context signature, evaluator, and intent interpreter\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"nexi/tests/test_context_assembler.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv89m1v_afd25b69f063\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The full test suite was executed to verify system integrity. While most modules passed, several tests in the context assembler module failed, indicating a regression or bug in context assembly logic.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Executing pytest on the xnchSystems repository\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:51:27.711Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Run full test suite\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"command_run\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv89pdf_be7fac50c8e1\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"context assembly pipeline\\\",\\\"unit testing\\\",\\\"mocking async stores\\\",\\\"proactive engine integration\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Tests cover assemble_context function using various mock stores (working_memory, pg_episodic, graph_store, relationship_store, sensory_buffer)\\\",\\\"Verifies AssembledContext message generation, including system prompts and proactivity engine integration\\\",\\\"Uses pytest and unittest.mock (AsyncMock, MagicMock) for dependency injection\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/tests/test_context_assembler.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv89pdf_be7fac50c8e1\\\",\\\"importance\\\":3,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Read the unit tests for the context assembler to understand the expected behavior of the pipeline, including how it handles working memory, graph entities, and proactive observations.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Reviewing unit tests for context assembly pipeline\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:51:32.017Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read test_context_assembler.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv89t4c_58f886eedcf2\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"defensive programming\\\",\\\"episodic memory retrieval\\\",\\\"safe dictionary access\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Replaced direct key access `r[\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\"]` with `r.get(\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\")` in the loop.\\\",\\\"Added a null check `if rid:` to prevent errors during episodic memory bumping.\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/pipeline/context_assembler.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv89t4c_58f886eedcf2\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The update introduces defensive programming to the context assembler's retrieval loop. This ensures that if a relevant record lacks an 'id' key, the system won't crash, improving the robustness of the episodic memory update process.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Updating context_assembler.py to use safe dictionary access for episodic memory updates\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:51:36.875Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Refactor context assembler for safer ID retrieval\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv89twx_8616ced9540a\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"Unit testing\\\",\\\"Mocking\\\",\\\"Data schema update\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Modified the return value of pg.retrieve_similar mock in tests/test_context_array.py\\\",\\\"Added 'id': 'ep-1' to the simulated deployment episode dictionary\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/tests/test_context_assembler.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv89twx_8616ced9540a\\\",\\\"importance\\\":4,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The test case was updated to include an 'id' field in the mocked similarity search results. This ensures the context assembler can handle objects containing unique identifiers for retrieved episodes.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Adding 'id' field to mock retrieval results\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:51:37.903Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Update mock data structure in test_context_assembler.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8a5cc_614677822e7e\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"async/await mismatch\\\",\\\"mocking coroutines\\\",\\\"unit testing failures\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"TypeError: object MagicMock can't be used in 'await' expression in nexi/pipeline/context_assembler.py:79\\\",\\\"The error occurs when calling await pg_episodic.bump_recall(rid)\\\",\\\"5 tests failed in nexi/tests/test_context_assembler.py\\\",\\\"InsecureKeyLengthWarning detected in jwt decoding tests\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"nexi/pipeline/context_assembler.py\\\",\\\"nexi/tests/test_context_assembler.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8a5cc_614677822e7e\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Running pytest revealed a regression or-unresolved bug in context_assembler.py where an async call to bump_recall is failing because the mock object is not awaitable.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Running test suite after context_assembler fix attempt\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:51:52.666Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"pytest failure in context_assembler\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"command_run\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8a90r_b61d90fdc1ee\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"unit testing\\\",\\\"mocking\\\",\\\"async mocking\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Updated pg.bump_recall to be an AsyncMock in the test suite\\\",\\\"Maintained existing pg.retrieve_similar mock configuration\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/tests/test_context_assembler.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8a90r_b61d90fdc1ee\\\",\\\"importance\\\":4,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The test file for context assembler was updated to include a mock for the bump_recall method. This ensures the new functionality is covered during unit testing.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Adding mock for bump_recall method in unit tests\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:51:57.478Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Update test_context_assembler.py with bump_recall mock\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8aixf_a91c4b1d4f9b\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"pytest\\\",\\\"JWT security\\\",\\\"unit testing\\\",\\\"HMAC key length\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"pytest executed successfully with 194 passed tests\\\",\\\"InsecureKeyLengthWarning detected in jwt/api_jwt.py (HMAC key length below 32 bytes)\\\",\\\"Tests in xnch/tests/test_working_memory.py passed\\\",\\\"12 warnings identified related to JWT key length security\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"xnch/tests/test_working_memory.py\\\",\\\"xnch/tests/test_auth.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8aixf_a91c4b1d4f9b\\\",\\\"importance\\\":4,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Ran the test suite to verify recent changes to mocks. The working memory tests passed, but security warnings were triggered in the auth tests due to insufficient HMAC key length.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Verification of recent fixes in working memory tests\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:10.318Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Run pytest for working memory and auth tests\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"command_run\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8anld_1e2a12d89a7e\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"LLM observability\\\",\\\"Langfuse tracing\\\",\\\"Python httpx client\\\",\\\"Basic Authentication\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Implements a LangfuseClient for LLM observability and tracing.\\\",\\\"Uses httpx for HTTP requests and Basic Auth for authentication.\\\",\\\"Sends trace data to the Langfuse ingestion API via /api/public/ingestion.\\\",\\\"Calculates generation IDs using SHA256 hashes of trace ID and timestamp.\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/observability/langfuse_client.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8anld_1e2a12d89a7e\\\",\\\"importance\\\":3,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The file contains the core implementation for sending LLM traces, prompts, and usage metrics to Langfuse. It provides a singleton-pattern client and a convenience function for tracing calls.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/observability/langfuse_client.py\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:16.368Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read Langfuse client implementation\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8anu7_9f3448f28b35\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"Voice Activity Detection (VAD)\\\",\\\"Whisper transcription\\\",\\\"Redis pub/sub or key-value storage\\\",\\\"Asyncio-based ML inference\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Uses Silero VAD for voice activity detection\\\",\\\"Uses Faster-Whisper for speech-to-text transcription\\\",\\\"Stores transcription results in Redis with a 60-second TTL\\\",\\\"Uses aioredis for asynchronous Redis communication\\\",\\\"Processes audio chunks using numpy and runs heavy ML models in executors to avoid blocking the event loop\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/perception/voice_daemon.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8anu7_9f3448f28b35\\\",\\\"importance\\\":3,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Read the implementation of VoiceDaemon to understand how audio recording, VAD, and transcription are managed within the perception module.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Examining the voice processing daemon implementation\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:16.686Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read voice_daemon.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8anyx_485410216522\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"Docker build process\\\",\\\"Python containerization\\\",\\\"uv dependency management\\\",\\\"Uvicorn ASGI server\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Base image: python:3.11-slim\\\",\\\"Working directory is /app\\\",\\\"Copies nexi/ directory and dependency files (pyproject.toml, uv.lock) into /app/nexi/\\\",\\\"Installs package using pip in editable mode\\\",\\\"Exposes port 8000\\\",\\\"Entrypoint uses uvicorn to run nexi.main:app\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/deploy/docker/nexi.Dockerfile\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8anyx_485410216522\\\",\\\"importance\\\":3,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The Dockerfile for the Nexi service was read to understand the build environment and runtime configuration. This provides details on the Python version, dependency management via uv/pip, and the application entry point.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Inspecting the containerization configuration for the Nexi application\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:16.856Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read Dockerfile for Nexi service\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8ao5q_a3aa74227674\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"Kubernetes CronJob\\\",\\\"Python asyncio\\\",\\\"K8s job scheduling\\\",\\\"Postgres connection strings\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"CronJob name: consolidation\\\",\\\"Namespace: xnch-system\\\",\\\"Schedule: 0 2 * * * (daily at 02:00)\\\",\\\"Container image: xnch/xnch-server:latest\\\",\\\"Execution command: python -c \\\\\\\"import asyncio; from xnch.jobs.consolidation import run_consolidation; asyncio.run(run_consolidation())\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"Environment variable XNCH_POSTGRES_URL uses $(POSTGRES_PASSWORD) secret placeholder\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/deploy/k8s/jobs/consolidation-cronjob.yaml\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8ao5q_a3aa74227674\\\",\\\"importance\\\":3,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The system read the Kubernetes CronJob definition for the consolidation task. This job runs a Python script within the xnch-server container on a daily schedule to perform data consolidation tasks.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Examining Kubernetes CronJob configuration for consolidation task\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:17.101Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read consolidation CronJob manifest\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8aqzt_6072696884bd\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"Kubernetes Deployment\\\",\\\"Kubernetes Service\\\",\\\"K8s Resource Limits\\\",\\\"NodeSelector\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Deployment name is 'xnch' in namespace 'xnch-system'\\\",\\\"Uses Recreate deployment strategy\\\",\\\"Container runs on nodes with role: memory\\\",\\\"Requires Redis and PostgreSQL (pgvector) connections\\\",\\\"Resource limits: 1.5Gi memory, 1 CPU; requests: 768Mi memory, 500m CPU\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/deploy/k8s/i7-node/xnch-deployment.yaml\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8aqzt_6072696884bd\\\",\\\"importance\\\":4,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Inspected the Kubernetes deployment and service manifest for the xnch application. The configuration defines the core deployment parameters, environment variables, and volume mounts for the xnch-server.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Examining xnch-deployment.yaml for service architecture\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:20.775Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read Kubernetes deployment configuration\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8atxe_fe33a2d415ed\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"LLM classification\\\",\\\"LiteLLM proxy\\\",\\\"Async HTTP requests\\\",\\\"Intent parsing\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"The `_classify_with_llm` method uses httpx to call a LiteLLM proxy.\\\",\\\"It uses the \\\\\\\"phi3-encoder\\\\\\\" model for classification.\\\",\\\"The request uses a system prompt and raw input to generate a JSON object response.\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/pipeline/intent_interpreter.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8atxe_fe33a2d415ed\\\",\\\"importance\\\":4,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Examined the implementation of the intent classification method within the pipeline. This code handles sending raw user input to an LLM endpoint to determine the user's intent.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Inspecting LLM classification logic in intent_interpreter.py\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:24.575Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read intent_interpreter.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8au28_2ccb4746896e\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)\\\",\\\"Python decorators\\\",\\\"FastAPI middleware logic\\\",\\\"Trust hierarchy\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"TrustLevel enum defines hierarchy: UNTRUSTED (1) to SYSTEM (5).\\\",\\\"ACTOR_TRUST_mapping assigns specific roles (nexi, openclaw, etc.) to trust levels.\\\",\\\"@requires_trust decorator enforces minimum trust levels by checking 'X-Actor-Role' header in FastAPI requests.\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/security/trust_model.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8au28_2ccb4746896e\\\",\\\"importance\\\":6,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Read the security trust model implementation to understand how actor permissions are enforced within the system. This file defines the core authorization logic based on actor identity.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Examination of trust level hierarchy and access control logic\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:24.750Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read security trust model definition\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8aubq_112a90f2e197\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"policy DSL\\\",\\\"LLM-driven governance\\\",\\\"pattern-based rule generation\\\",\\\"SQLite persistence\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Module implements an LLM-driven policy rule proposal system.\\\",\\\"Reads low-success, high-confidence patterns from PatternStore.\\\",\\\"Uses LiteLLM proxy at http://localhost:4000/v1/chat/completions.\\\",\\\"Outputs policy rules with ALLOW/BLOCK/MODIFY/DEFER verdicts to SQLite.\\\",\\\"Uses 'claude-judgment' model.\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/learning/policy_candidates.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8aubq_112a90f2e197\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The file contains the logic for generating new policy candidates based on identified patterns. This is a core component of the autonomous governance loop.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Examining the Policy Candidate Generator implementation\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:25.091Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read policy_candidates.py module\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8auiv_405cd7293f76\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"data seeding\\\",\\\"episodic memory\\\",\\\"identity management\\\",\\\"PgEpisodicStore\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"IDENTITY_FACTS contains core identity traits for 'ck-san'\\\",\\\"ck-san is a Senior Platform Engineer at Rakuten India\\\",\\\"XNCH is the orchestration platform; Nexi is the product interface layer\\\",\\\"Local setup uses Gemma 4 26B on RTX 3090\\\",\\\"seed_identity_memories function populates PgEpisodicStore\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/character/cold_start_seeder.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8auiv_405cd7293f76\\\",\\\"importance\\\":3,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Read the cold start seeder script to understand the foundational identity facts being injected into the episodic memory store. This script ensures the agent starts with the correct persona and technical context.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Inspecting cold start seed data for character identity\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:25.349Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read identity seeding script\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8ax9x_e98842d178d2\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"regex-based intent classification\\\",\\\"entity extraction\\\",\\\"NLP pipeline\\\",\\\"intent classification\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Uses regex patterns in _RULES to map input to IntentClass (DECISION, ESCALATION, etc.)\\\",\\\"_rule_classify function iterates through compiled regex patterns to determine intent\\\",\\\"_extract_entity function performs basic tokenization to identify entity IDs and types (ML_MODEL, SERVICE, DATABASE, etc.)\\\",\\\"Identifies resource types like CLUSTER, FILE, SCRIPT, and SCHEMA based on keyword hints\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/pipeline/intent_interpreter.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8ax9x_e98842d178d2\\\",\\\"importance\\\":3,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Examined the core logic of the intent interpreter pipeline. This reveals how user inputs are parsed into structured intents and how entities are extracted from raw text strings.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Inspecting intent classification rules and extraction logic\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:28.915Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read intent_interpreter.py implementation\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8axl5_875e3e675099\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"rule-based action triggering\\\",\\\"user idle detection\\\",\\\"asynchronous task scheduling\\\",\\\"background consolidation\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"The filter triggers a 'trigger_file_watcher' action when a vault file is saved.\\\",\\\"The filter triggers 'suppress_responses_and_consolidate' when user idle duration exceeds a timeout.\\\",\\\"Idle timeout triggers an asynchronous consolidation job via 'run_consolidation'.\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/perception/attention_filter.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8axl5_875e3e675099\\\",\\\"importance\\\":3,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The file contains logic for evaluating rules to determine system actions. It specifically handles file watcher triggers and automated consolidation tasks based on user activity levels.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Inspecting rule-based action triggering in perception module\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:29.319Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read attention_filter.py logic\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8axyj_57577f52e77b\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"prompt injection prevention\\\",\\\"regex security filters\\\",\\\"negative lookahead\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"File: /Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/security/injection_guard.py\\\",\\\"Contains regex patterns for detecting prompt injection attempts\\\",\\\"Pattern 1: 'disregard...above' (case-insensitive)\\\",\\\"Pattern 2: 'act as (?!Nexi)' (negative lookahead to prevent persona hijacking)\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/security/injection_guard.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8axyj_57577f52e77b\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The engine inspected specific lines of the injection guard security module. These regex patterns are designed to detect common prompt injection techniques like instruction overriding and persona impersonation.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Inspecting security filters in injection_guard.py\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:29.802Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read injection guard regex patterns\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8b6zf_478d300b9b96\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"async/await\\\",\\\"httpx AsyncClient\\\",\\\"Observability client refactoring\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Changed self._client from httpx.Client to httpx.AsyncClient\\\",\\\"Replaced close() method with async aclose() method\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/observability/langfuse_client.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8b6zf_478d300b9b96\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The LangfuseClient was updated to use an asynchronous HTTP client (httpx.AsyncClient) to support non-blocking I/O operations. This change prepares the observability client for async-compatible workflows.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Migrating from synchronous httpx.Client to httpx.AsyncClient\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:41.497Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Refactor LangfuseClient to use AsyncClient\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8b7gt_6d182976e2f8\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"audio signal processing\\\",\\\"numpy buffer conversion\\\",\\\"PCM normalization\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Changed input dtype from np.float32 to np.int16\\\",\\\"Added normalization by dividing by 32768.0 to scale int16 range to [-1.0, 1.0]\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/perception/voice_daemon.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8b7gt_6d182976e2f8\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The audio buffer was incorrectly being read as float32. This change ensures the raw buffer is read as int16 and then normalized to float32 for consistent processing.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Corrected buffer interpretation from float32 to int16 before normalization\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:42.122Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Fix audio buffer dtype conversion in voice_daemon.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8b8h6_41bdbec8f6a6\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"Docker layer caching\\\",\\\"Python runtime upgrade\\\",\\\"Multi-stage build optimization\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Updated base image from python:3.11-slim to python:3.13-slim\\\",\\\"Reordered COPY instructions to copy pyproject.toml before the full directory to improve layer caching\\\",\\\"Removed redundant COPY nexi/ before pyproject.toml in the new version\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/deploy/docker/nexi.Dockerfile\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8b8h6_41bdbec8f6a6\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The Dockerfile was updated to use a newer Python runtime and optimize build caching by placing dependency files earlier in the layer sequence. This reduces rebuild time when only source code changes.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Upgrading Python version and restructuring Dockerfile layers\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:43.432Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Update Docker base image and optimize COPY layers\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8b8zp_4fc8ffd95f50\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"Kubernetes secrets\\\",\\\"environment variable refactoring\\\",\\\"secure credential management\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Modified /Users/xnch/xnchSystems/deploy/k8s/jobs/consolidation-cronjob.yaml\\\",\\\"Replaced hardcoded POSTGRES_PASSWORD environment variable with secretKeyRef from xnch-secret\\\",\\\"Maintained XNCH_POSTGRES_URL using the updated POSTGRES_PASSWORD variable\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/deploy/k8s/jobs/consolidation-cronjob.yaml\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8b8zp_4fc8ffd95f50\\\",\\\"importance\\\":6,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The deployment configuration was updated to use a Kubernetes secret for the database password instead of relying on an-injected environment variable. This improves security by following best practices for credential management in K8s.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Migrate XNCH_POSTGRES_URL from plain text variable to Kubernetes secret reference\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:44.099Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Refactor postgres password retrieval in cronjob\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8ba0r_b0a65006c462\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"Kubernetes Secrets\\\",\\\"Environment Variable Refactoring\\\",\\\"K8s deployment configuration\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Replaced hardcoded POSTGRES_PASSWORD environment variable with valueFrom SecretKeyRef\\\",\\\"Source secret name: xnch-secret\\\",\\\"Secret key: postgres_password\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/deploy/k8s/i7-node/xnch-deployment.yaml\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8ba0r_b0a65006c462\\\",\\\"importance\\\":6,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Modified the Kubernetes deployment configuration to improve security by fetching the PostgreSQL password from a Kubernetes Secret instead of using a potentially plaintext environment variable. This change ensures credentials are managed via the K8s secret store.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Updating xnch-deployment.yaml to use SecretKeyRef for database credentials\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:45.431Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Refactor Postgres password retrieval in K8s deployment\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8bakx_f1b4f7b68ce7\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"string parsing\\\",\\\"tokenization\\\",\\\"intent interpretation\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Changed entity_id extraction from single token (tokens[1]) to a joined string of all remaining tokens (tokens[1:])\\\",\\\"This allows for multi-word entity identifiers in the input string\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/pipeline/intent_interpreter.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8bakx_f1b4f7b68ce7\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The parsing logic in intent_interpreter.py was updated to handle entity IDs that contain spaces. Previously, only the first token after the command was captured; now, all subsequent tokens are joined into a single entity_id string.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Modified entity_id extraction logic in intent_interpreter.py\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:46.159Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Update intent interpreter token parsing\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8bb0c_9907c36303cf\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"LLM configuration\\\",\\\"model switching\\\",\\\"intent interpreter\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Changed model configuration from 'phi3-encoder' to 'gemma4-local' in /Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/pipeline/intent_interpreter.py\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/pipeline/intent_interpreter.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8bb0c_9907c36303cf\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The model configuration within the intent interpreter pipeline was updated to use the gemma4-local model instead of phi3-encoder. This change likely reflects an upgrade or shift in the underlying LLM architecture being used for intent processing.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Swapping phi3-encoder for gemma4-local\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:46.714Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Update model identifier in intent_interpreter.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8bbr1_1bdf406d1861\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"type safety\\\",\\\"Python type checking\\\",\\\"duck typing\\\",\\\"middleware security\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Modified /Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/security/trust_model.py\\\",\\\"Replaced hasattr(arg, 'headers') check with isinstance(arg, Request) check\\\",\\\"Updated logic for both positional args and keyword kwargs\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/security/trust_model.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8bbr1_1bdf406d1861\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Refactored the way the trust model identifies the Request object within function arguments. This moves from a duck-typing approach to explicit type checking with the Request class, improving type safety and predictability.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Switch from duck-typing (hasattr) to explicit type checking (isinstance) for Request objects\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:47.675Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Refactor request extraction logic in trust_model.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8bcxa_84c4171434c8\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"environment configuration\\\",\\\"dynamic configuration\\\",\\\"liteLLM proxy\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Changed _LLM_URL from a hardcoded localhost address to a conditional check using settings.litellm_proxy_url\\\",\\\"Fallback URL is set to http://litellm:4000/v1/chat/completions if setting is missing\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/learning/policy_candidates.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8bcxa_84c4171434c8\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The code was updated to allow for more flexible LLM endpoint configuration via a settings object. This allows the system to transition from local development defaults to a service-based proxy URL.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Refactoring _LLM_URL in policy_candidates.py to support configurable liteLLM proxy URL\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:49.195Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Update LLM URL to use dynamic settings\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8bfma_06f1686a7727\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"Pydantic Settings\\\",\\\"Environment configuration\\\",\\\"System architecture paths\\\",\\\"Observability (Langfuse)\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Application base directory is ~/.xnch\\\",\\\"Uses Pydantic Settings with XNCH_ environment prefix\\\",\\\"Config defines paths for keys, audit, governance, policies, and weights\\\",\\\"Includes Redis, PostgreSQL (pgvector), and Langfuse observability settings\\\",\\\"Contains perception-related thresholds for attention and silence detection\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/config.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8bfma_06f1686a7727\\\",\\\"importance\\\":3,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The file was read to understand the global application configuration, including directory structures, database URLs, and runtime thresholds for the perception engine.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Inspecting Settings class in config.py\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:52.689Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read application configuration\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8bix2_2a67b73c90fa\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"LiteLLM proxy\\\",\\\"model configuration\\\",\\\"LLM orchestration\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Added `litellm_proxy_url` set to \\\\\\\"http://litellm:4000\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"Added `graph_extractor_model` set to \\\\\\\"ollama/phi3:mini\\\\\\\"\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/config.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8bix2_2a67b73c90fa\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Modified the configuration file to include proxy URL and specific model identifier for the graph extractor component. This enables integration with LiteLLM and specifies the local Ollama model to use.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Configuring LiteLLM proxy and model paths in configuration\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:52:56.964Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Update config.py with LiteLLM and Graph Extractor settings\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8blf8_2d29023444e8\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"LLM proxy configuration\\\",\\\"LiteLLM integration\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"_LLM_URL is derived from settings.litellm_proxy_url or defaults to http://litellm:4000/v1/chat/completions\\\",\\\"The file belongs to the xnch learning module\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/learning/policy_candidates.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8blf8_2d29023444e8\\\",\\\"importance\\\":3,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Read a snippet of policy_candidates.py to understand how LLM completion URLs are constructed. This is part of an investigation into where the litellm proxy configuration is defined.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Inspecting LLM endpoint configuration in learning module\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:53:00.209Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read policy_candidates.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8boet_3451722dcdd0\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"URL path manipulation\\\",\\\"Environment configuration\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/learning/policy_candidates.py updated\\\",\\\"Removed conditional logic for litellm_proxy_url fallback\\\",\\\"Added .rstrip(\\\\\\\"/\\\\\\\") to settings.litellm_proxy_url to prevent double slashes\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnch/xnch/learning/policy_candidates.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8boet_3451722dcdd0\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The code was refactored to use a more robust string concatenation method for the LLM endpoint URL. This ensures that the URL remains valid regardless of whether the setting ends with a trailing slash.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Refactoring _LLM_URL to use rstrip for safer path joining\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:53:04.083Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Update LLM URL construction in policy_candidates.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8bria_55285617160f\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[],\\\"confidence\\\":0.85,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Replaced manual iteration over episodic_store.list_recent with a targeted search_memory call\\\",\\\"Updated logic to use search_memory with filter_metadata for \\\\\\\"identity\\\\\\\" type\\\",\\\"Reduced complexity from O(N) scan to targeted retrieval\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/character/cold_start_seeder.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8bria_55285617160f\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"The identity check in the cold start seeder was refactored to use the more efficient search_memory API. This optimizes the check by searching specifically for identities rather than scanning all recent episodes.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Switching from episodic_store.list_recent to agentmemory.search_memory for identity detection\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:53:08.094Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Refactor identity check in cold_start_seeder.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8bsar_3721a21a6248\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"asyncio error handling\\\",\\\"background task monitoring\\\",\\\"callback pattern\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"Modified asyncio.create_task call in attention_filter.py\\\",\\\"Added a callback to catch and log exceptions from the run_consolidation task\\\",\\\"Stored the task reference as 'task' instead of just calling the function\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/perception/attention_filter.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8bsar_3721a21a6248\\\",\\\"importance\\\":5,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Improved error observability for the background consolidation job. Previously, if the background task failed, it would fail silently. Now, it logs an error to the logger if an exception occurs.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Updating attention_filter.py to log exceptions in background job\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:53:09.121Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Add error handling to background consolidation task\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_edit\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8bsi8_4b694477867b\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"asyncio\\\",\\\"perception module\\\",\\\"attention filtering\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":0.9,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"File path: /Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/perception/attention_filter.py\\\",\\\"Class AttentionFilter uses asyncio and depends on ..config.settings\\\"],\\\"files\\\":[\\\"/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/xnch/xnch/perception/attention_filter.py\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"obs_mqv8bsi8_4b694477867b\\\",\\\"importance\\\":2,\\\"narrative\\\":\\\"Read the first 10 lines of the attention filter implementation to understand its dependencies and initialization structure. This file is part of the perception system.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"ses_0fb0da627ffe1MoEyui2GTY7HI\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Inspecting initial lines of the perception module's attention filter\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-06-26T17:53:09.391Z\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Read attention_filter.py\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"file_read\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"compressed\\\"},\\\"obs_mqv8bv7c_a4f37c6607d3\\\":{\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"concepts\\\":[\\\"Python imports\\\",\\\"asynchronous programming\\\",\\\"relative module imports\\\"],\\\"confidence\\\":1,\\\"facts\\\":[\\\"File uses asyncio and time modules\\\",\\\"File imports Any from typing\\\",\\\"File uses relative import from ..config\\\"],\\\"files\\